<title>INDONESIA: Jaya Real Property 1996 net edges up.</title>
<headline>Jaya Real Property 1996 net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's PT Jaya Real Property said on Friday it had posted a net profit of 120 billion rupiah in 1996, against 109.61 billion rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it had reached its 1996 revenue target of 320 billion rupiah but did not provide a breakdown. It forecast a 10 percent increase in profit in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
